From 237986a8a567284965865dc0622a220d7b1b0546 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: grubbychicken <ben@grbychkn.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 21:37:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ML4 prefill fc1 on route rows (ML4_PF_RX, default off):
 k_pf_rot, k_pf_fc1 RX, k_pf_fc1r tiles; timing probes

Same bits as k_pf_fc1 in both modes; neither is faster on a Spark (the route-row pass is memory-bound, the tile CTA
runs one per SM). Kept as measured, off by default. ML4_PF_RXP / ML4_PF_PAD are timing probes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 engine/kernels/bind_prefill.cuh | 334 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 1 file changed, 321 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)

